sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Payment 1
    participant P2 as Payment 2
    participant P3 as Payment 3
    participant F as Fee account row<br/>id = 0
    P1->>F: UPDATE balance + fee — row lock GRANTED
    P2->>F: UPDATE balance + fee — WAITS
    P3->>F: UPDATE balance + fee — WAITS
    Note over P1: COMMIT waits for its<br/>WAL flush, lock held
    P1-->>F: committed, lock released
    F-->>P2: lock granted
    Note over P2: COMMIT waits for its own flush
    P2-->>F: committed, lock released
    F-->>P3: lock granted
    Note over F: one flush at a time<br/>32 clients: 325 tps<br/>1 client: 327 tps
